@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### Comprobar que la API funciona
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Crear un espacio
POST {{baseUrl}}/spaces
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "spaceName": "Sala Norte",
  "type": "meeting_room",
  "capacity": 10,
  "status": "active",
  "description": "Sala con proyector"
}

### Listar espacios con filtro, orden y paginacion
GET {{baseUrl}}/spaces?type=meeting_room&status=active&sort_by=capacity&direction=asc&page=1&limit=20

### Error de validacion: capacidad incorrecta (422 VALIDATION_ERROR)
POST {{baseUrl}}/spaces
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "spaceName": "Sala incorrecta",
  "type": "meeting_room",
  "capacity": 0,
  "description": "Ejemplo de error"
}

### Error de validacion: tipo de espacio inexistente (422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/spaces
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "spaceName": "Sala tipo invalido",
  "type": "no_existe",
  "capacity": 5,
  "description": "Ejemplo de error"
}

### Crear una empresa (RUT con digito verificador valido, modulo 11)
POST {{baseUrl}}/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "Empresa Uno",
  "rut": "12345678-5",
  "email": "empresa@ejemplo.cl",
  "phone": "12345678",
  "address": "Calle Principal 123"
}

### Empresa duplicada: mismo RUT (409 CONFLICT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "Empresa Duplicada",
  "rut": "12345678-5",
  "email": "otra@ejemplo.cl",
  "phone": "87654321",
  "address": "Otra Calle 456"
}

### RUT con digito verificador incorrecto (400 BUSINESS_RULE_VIOLATION)
POST {{baseUrl}}/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "Empresa Rut Malo",
  "rut": "12345678-0",
  "email": "mala@ejemplo.cl",
  "phone": "12345678",
  "address": "Calle Principal 123"
}

### Recurso que no existe (404 RESOURCE_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{baseUrl}}/spaces/id-inexistente

### Para las siguientes pruebas, reemplazar los ID con los obtenidos arriba
@spaceId = REEMPLAZAR_ID_ESPACIO
@companyId = REEMPLAZAR_ID_EMPRESA

### Obtener un espacio por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/spaces/{{spaceId}}

### Actualizar un espacio (PUT acepta actualizacion parcial; PATCH es alias)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/spaces/{{spaceId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "capacity": 12
}

### Obtener una empresa por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}

### Actualizar una empresa
PUT {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "87654321"
}

### Crear una disponibilidad
POST {{baseUrl}}/availabilities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "spaceId": "{{spaceId}}",
  "weekday": "monday",
  "opening_time": "09:00:00",
  "closing_time": "18:00:00"
}

### Disponibilidad solapada mismo espacio+dia (409 CONFLICT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/availabilities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "spaceId": "{{spaceId}}",
  "weekday": "monday",
  "opening_time": "10:00:00",
  "closing_time": "12:00:00"
}

### Listar disponibilidades con filtros y paginacion
GET {{baseUrl}}/availabilities?space_id={{spaceId}}&weekday=monday&page=1&limit=10

### Crear una reserva (nace siempre en estado "pending")
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "spaceId": "{{spaceId}}",
  "companyId": "{{companyId}}",
  "start_date": "2030-01-10T10:00:00",
  "end_date": "2030-01-10T11:00:00",
  "reason": "Reunion de planificacion"
}

### Intentar una reserva superpuesta: debe responder 409 CONFLICT
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "spaceId": "{{spaceId}}",
  "companyId": "{{companyId}}",
  "start_date": "2030-01-10T10:30:00",
  "end_date": "2030-01-10T11:30:00",
  "reason": "Reserva en conflicto"
}

### Confirmar una reserva (transicion pending -> confirmed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservations/REEMPLAZAR_ID_RESERVA/confirm

### Cancelar una reserva (libera el horario; transicion a "canceled", terminal)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservations/REEMPLAZAR_ID_RESERVA/cancel

### Transicion ilegal: canceled -> confirmed (400 BUSINESS_RULE_VIOLATION)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/reservations/REEMPLAZAR_ID_RESERVA
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "confirmed"
}

### Listar reservas con filtros (space_id, company_id, status), orden y paginacion
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations?page=1&limit=20&sort_by=created_at&direction=desc

### Filtrar reservas por estado
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations?status=pending&company_id={{companyId}}
